+// === Fact-key display labels ==============================================
+
+/// Landlord-facing label for a recognised fact key. The default humanises
+/// the snake_case key; `employer_name` gets the explicit form label
+/// "Employer / business name" (user ruling 2026-08-04) so the audit PDF's
+/// AI-evidence section matches the application-snapshot data line — one
+/// field, one label end-to-end. Note this runs at ingest (contract_v4
+/// decode): analyses stored before the ruling keep the old label on
+/// re-render — cosmetic, historical-only, self-healing.
+fn display_label_for_key(key: String) -> String {
+  case key {
+    "employer_name" -> "Employer / business name"
+    other -> capitalise_first(snake_to_spaces(other))
+  }
+}
